{"product_id":"lost-vape-quest-orion-pod-kit","title":"Lost Vape Quest Orion Pod Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Lost Vape Orion is where cutting-edge technology meets premium craftsmanship. Designed for vapers who demand performance and style, this iconic pod system delivers a powerful, customizable, and ultra-smooth vaping experience in a compact, luxury build.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePowered by the advanced DNA chipset (in select variants), the Orion ensures precise power control, consistent output, and enhanced flavour delivery—making every puff feel refined and satisfying.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLost Vape Orion Q Specs:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 93 mm x 37 mm x 13.5 mm\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInternal Rechargeable Battery: 950mAh\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaximum Wattage Output: 40W – out of the box set to 17w\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 2ml \/ 1ohm\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual Adjustable Airflow\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeak Battery Protection\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTemperature Protection\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow\/High Resistance Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Lost Vape","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42173934174263,"sku":"L V Quest Orion Pod Kit","price":2700.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Lost-Vape-Orion.webp?v=1775264069","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/lost-vape-quest-orion-pod-kit","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




